 <h3><u>Chehlum karo karbala mein</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>HUSSAIN .. (3)</p> 
  <p>Ghareeb e ZAHRA ke naukar, yeh Aashiqan e Aza<br> Rahe wafa pe chale hain Musafiran e Aza<br> Dua e FATEMA ZAHRA ke saayebaan ki tarah<br> Chale hain janib e manzil yeh karwan e Aza</p> 
  <p>(Salam Zaeraan e HUSSAIN<br> Salam Aashiqan e HUSSAIN ).. (2)<br> (Safar e Ishq e HUSSAIN&nbsp; ).. (2)</p> 
  <p>Hussainiyo'n..........</p> 
  <p>Hussainiyo'n tumhe KARBOBALA bulati hain<br> Safar e Ishq par chalo, saath mere Hussainiyo'n<br> Sunnat e BIBI ZAINAB&nbsp;&nbsp; ko pura karo<br> Hal min ki sada par Labbaik kaho</p> 
  <p>Labbaik ya HUSSAIN.. (4)</p> 
  <p>Rasm e SAJJAD puri karo.. (2)</p> 
  <p>KARBALA ke shaheedo'n ka ,<br> Chehlum karo KARBALA me.. (2)</p> 
  <p>Ya HUSSAIN</p> 
  <p>Chehlum karo KARBALA me.. (2)</p> 
  <p>(1) Zaeraan e HUSSAIN<br> KARBALA ka yeh gham.. (2)<br> Dil me zinda rahe, ek pal na ho kam<br> Saal bhar majlisein ho, rahe aankh nam<br> Baad e Ashoor hathon me lekar alam.. (2)<br> Qafila ek tarteeb do..<br> KARBALA ke shaheedo'n ka</p> 
  <p>Chehlum karo KARBALA me.. (4)</p> 
  <p>(2) Jiski chadar ko tum<br> roye ho umr bhar.. (2)<br> Jiska ek roz me, lut gaya sara ghar<br> Apne marqad me kehti hai woh nauhaghar<br> Main bhi jati hoo'n, tum bhi karo yeh safar.. (2)<br> Hukm e ZAINAB ki takmeel ho..<br> KARBALA ke shaheedo'n ka</p> 
  <p>Chehlum karo KARBALA me.. (4)</p> 
  <p>(3) Sabr ka woh khuda<br> Yaani ZAINUL IBA.. (2)<br> Pehenkar bediyaan, Khoon rota raha<br> KARBALA se sue Sham paidal gaya<br> Chhutke zindaan se phir sue KARBALA.. (2)<br> Jis tarah woh chala, tum chalo<br> KARBALA ke shaheedo'n ka</p> 
  <p>Chehlum karo KARBALA me.. (4)</p> 
  <p>(4) Baap ki yaad me<br> dil jalati hain woh.. (2)<br> Qaid khane mein gham yu manati hain woh<br> Apne baba ko ab bhi bulati hain woh<br> Karne chehlum sue dasht jati hain woh.. (2)<br> Gar SAKINA ke ghamkhwar ho,<br> KARBALA ke shaheedo'n ka</p> 
  <p>Chehlum karo KARBALA me.. (4)</p> 
  <p>(5) Hain safar ishq ka<br> Ek musalsal safar.. (2)<br> Karya Karya safar, Sehra jungle safar<br> Sardi garmi ho din raat paidal safar<br> KARBALA tak NAJAF se woh paidal safar.. (2)<br> Mere humrah tum bhi karo<br> KARBALA ke shaheedo'n ka</p> 
  <p>Chehlum karo KARBALA me.. (4)</p> 
  <p>(6) Door hogi thakan<br> us ghadi Ahle gham.. (2)<br> KARBALA mein rakhoge jo pehla qadam<br> Hogi pesh e nazar qabr e Shahe Umam<br> Ek maa ki fugha'n sun ke royenge hum.. (2)<br> Mere zakhmo'n ka marham bano<br> KARBALA ke shaheedo'n ka</p> 
  <p>Chehlum karo KARBALA me.. (4)</p> 
  <p>(7) Ashiqaan e HUSSAIN<br> Ishq imaan hain.. (2)<br> Ishq ka yeh safar, dil hain aur jaan hain<br> Haan yeh Irfan o MAazhar ka ailaan hain<br> BINT E ZAHRA&nbsp; ka, ZAHRA ka armaan hain.. (2)<br> Unka armaan pura karo<br> KARBALA ke shaheedo'n ka</p> 
  <p>Chehlum karo KARBALA me.. (4)</p> 
  <p>Allahumma ar zuqna fid duniya ZIYARATIL HUSSAIN&nbsp;</p> 
